☁️ AWS Core Services (Very Important)
What is EC2?
👉 Virtual server in AWS to run applications.
What is S3?
👉 Object storage service used for backups, static websites, logs.
Difference between EC2 and S3?
👉 EC2 = compute, S3 = storage.
What is VPC?
👉 Virtual private network in AWS to isolate resources.
What is IAM?
👉 Identity & Access Management to control user permissions.
IAM User vs Role?
User → Human access
Role → AWS services access
